sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant R as Reviews.jsx
  participant BE as PUT /products/ID/reviews/me
  participant DB as SQLite
  U->>R: stars and text
  R->>BE: PUT review
  BE->>DB: has a paid or COD, non-cancelled order with this product?
  alt no
    BE-->>R: 403 only buyers can review
  else yes
    BE->>DB: upsert review (one per user per product)
    BE->>DB: rating = (rating * n + new) / (n + 1), reviews = n + 1
    BE-->>R: updated review list
    R->>R: parent refetches the product (new average)
  end
